{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"4ebdf6cfeea6c867c31051ac","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2%40nexthop.ai/","channels":["linux-arm-kernel","linux-i2c","lkml"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2%40nexthop.ai/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai"},"subject":"[PATCH v2] i2c: xiic: restore runtime PM teardown in remove to fix clk WARN flood","messages":{"20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai":{"id":"20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai","messageId":"20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai","references":[],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Abdurrahman Hussain","address":"abdurrahman@nexthop.ai"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Michal Simek","address":"michal.simek@amd.com"},{"name":"Andi Shyti","address":"andi.shyti@kernel.org"},{"name":"Andy Shevchenko","address":"andriy.shevchenko@intel.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-i2c@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"Abdurrahman Hussain","address":"abdurrahman@nexthop.ai"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T18:04:45.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T18:04:45.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH v2] i2c: xiic: restore runtime PM teardown in remove to fix clk WARN flood","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-i2c.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-i2c.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The devres conversion dropped the remove-time runtime PM trailer\n(pm_runtime_disable + pm_runtime_set_suspended +\npm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend). devm_pm_runtime_enable's release\naction then calls pm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() while runtime PM\nis still enabled, triggering an immediate runtime suspend: the suspend\ncallback clk_disable()s the clock that the devm_clk_get_enabled()\nrelease is about to clk_disable_unprepare(), and every device teardown\nWARNs in clk_core_disable() (\"clkN already disabled\")."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Restore the trailer: with runtime PM disabled and the state forced to\nsuspended before devres runs, the suspend callback cannot fire and the\nclock enable count stays balanced."},{"kind":"code","text":"Fixes: 50c63491ff26 (\"i2c: xiic: switch to devres managed APIs\")"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Abdurrahman Hussain <abdurrahman@nexthop.ai>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai:0:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai:0:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[]},"aoHf6UDxD68YxLYm@zenone.zhora.eu":{"id":"aoHf6UDxD68YxLYm@zenone.zhora.eu","messageId":"aoHf6UDxD68YxLYm@zenone.zhora.eu","references":["20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@nexthop.ai"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Andi Shyti","address":"andi.shyti@kernel.org"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Abdurrahman Hussain","address":"abdurrahman@nexthop.ai"}],"cc":[{"name":"Michal Simek","address":"michal.simek@amd.com"},{"name":"Andy Shevchenko","address":"andriy.shevchenko@intel.com"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-i2c@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T16:14:08.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T16:14:08.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH v2] i2c: xiic: restore runtime PM teardown in remove to fix clk WARN flood","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-kernel.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-kernel.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Hi Abdurrahman,"},{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On Fri, Aug 14, 2026 at 11:04:45AM -0700, Abdurrahman Hussain wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"The devres conversion dropped the remove-time runtime PM trailer"},{"depth":1,"text":"(pm_runtime_disable + pm_runtime_set_suspended +"},{"depth":1,"text":"pm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend). devm_pm_runtime_enable's release"},{"depth":1,"text":"action then calls pm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() while runtime PM"},{"depth":1,"text":"is still enabled, triggering an immediate runtime suspend: the suspend"},{"depth":1,"text":"callback clk_disable()s the clock that the devm_clk_get_enabled()"},{"depth":1,"text":"release is about to clk_disable_unprepare(), and every device teardown"},{"depth":1,"text":"WARNs in clk_core_disable() (\"clkN already disabled\")."}],"lineCount":8,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"isn't devm_pm_runtime_set_active_enabled() calling\npm_runtime_disable() + pm_runtime_set_suspended() + \npm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() at teardown?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Thanks,\nAndi"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"Restore the trailer: with runtime PM disabled and the state forced to"},{"depth":1,"text":"suspended before devres runs, the suspend callback cannot fire and the"},{"depth":1,"text":"clock enable count stays balanced."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Fixes: 50c63491ff26 (\"i2c: xiic: switch to devres managed APIs\")"},{"depth":1,"text":"Signed-off-by: Abdurrahman Hussain <abdurrahman@nexthop.ai>"},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":"Changes in v2:"},{"depth":1,"text":"- Move the Signed-off-by into the commit message proper; v1 had it below"},{"depth":1,"text":"  the '---' cutter line where it would be dropped on apply (Andy)."},{"depth":1,"text":"- Link to v1: https://patch.msgid.link/20260813-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v1-1-0e7dfb206790@nexthop.ai"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"To: Michal Simek <michal.simek@amd.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"To: Andi Shyti <andi.shyti@kernel.org>"},{"depth":1,"text":"To: Andy Shevchenko <andriy.shevchenko@intel.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"To: Abdurrahman Hussain <abdurrahman@nexthop.ai>"},{"depth":1,"text":"Cc: linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"},{"depth":1,"text":"Cc: linux-i2c@vger.kernel.org"},{"depth":1,"text":"Cc: linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":" drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-xiic.c | 3 +++"},{"depth":1,"text":" 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"diff --git a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-xiic.c b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-xiic.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"index 3e7735e1dae0..89636ca36915 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"--- a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-xiic.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"+++ b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-xiic.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -1545,6 +1545,9 @@ static void xiic_i2c_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)"},{"depth":1,"text":" \t\txiic_deinit(i2c);"},{"depth":1,"text":" "},{"depth":1,"text":" \tpm_runtime_put_sync(dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"+\tpm_runtime_disable(dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"+\tpm_runtime_set_suspended(dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"+\tpm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend(dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":" }"},{"depth":1,"text":" "},{"depth":1,"text":" static const struct dev_pm_ops xiic_dev_pm_ops = {"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":"base-commit: d58772d8520c7ef247c4b95c9bd76d3a25da9ff5"},{"depth":1,"text":"change-id: 20260813-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-dd0ab1db2c02"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Best regards,"},{"depth":1,"text":"--  "},{"depth":1,"text":"Abdurrahman Hussain <abdurrahman@nexthop.ai>"},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":46,"maximumDepth":1}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":1,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260814-i2c-xiic-restore-runtime-pm-teardown-v2-1-7ae5d0c30ff2@ne